{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309610","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309610","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130961001:1":{"text":"저 트레져 헌터들을 보세요. 오랫동안 고생해서 결국 아무것도 얻은 게 없잖아요. 그 과정에 온몸에 상처를 입었을지도 모르고… 참 안타까운 일이죠.","source_cn":"你看那些寻宝者，辛辛苦苦找了这么久，最后却一无所获，说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10068291E410DEEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130961002:1":{"text":"그에 비해 고고학은 보장이 있어요! ","source_cn":"相比起来，还是考古更有保障！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C088899854EFDD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130961003:1":{"text":"적어도 협회가 저희를 보낸 곳엔 역사적 유적이 있는 건 확실하고, 주변에 큰 위험도 없을 테니까요.","source_cn":"至少，协会派我们来的地方都确定会有历史遗迹，周围也没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A7823CD635E9613","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130961004:1":{"text":"저희만 열심히 연구하면, 수확은 분명 있답니다!","source_cn":"只要我们认真研究，总不至于半点收获也没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33660A5CE6313256","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:学者朱利安":{"text":"학자 줄리안","source":"学者朱利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}